   SYNOPSIS
	depth = MB_SetDepth( depth )
	d0                   d0

	ULONG MB_SetDepth(ULONG);

   FUNCTION
	Sets the framebuffer's colour depth in bits per pixel, using
	property tag SET_DEPTH (0x00048005). Must be called before
	MB_AllocateBuffer().

   INPUTS
